<title>QATAR: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>QATAR GOVERNMENT LIST (961029-2)</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p> * 29 Oct 96 - The emir named his younger brother, Sheikh   *</p>
<p> *		 Abdullah bin Khalifa al-Thani, as prime	*</p>
<p> *		 minister and asked him to form a new	   *</p>
<p> *		 government. He is expected to announce the   *</p>
<p> *		 cabinet within a few days.			 *</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p> Emir (Ruler)...............Sheikh HAMAD bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Defence)</p>
<p> Crown Prince (heir apparent).........Sheikh JASSIM bin Hamad</p>
<p>						     bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET:</p>
<p> Prime Minister..........Sheikh ABDULLAH bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(Apptd 29 Oct 96, also Minister of the Interior)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>OUTGOING CABINET (Formed 11 July 1995):</p>
<p> Communications, Transport............Abdullah Saleh al-MANNA</p>
<p> Defence.............................................See Emir</p>
<p> Education..........................Abdel-Aziz Abdullah TURKI</p>
<p> Emiri Court..................Sheikh HAMAD bin Sahim al-Thani</p>
<p>Endowments &amp; Islamic</p>
<p>     Affairs..............Sheikh ABDULLAH bin Khaled al-Thani</p>
<p> Energy &amp; Industry..............Abdullah bin Hamad al-ATTIYAH</p>
<p>Finance, Economy &amp;</p>
<p>     Trade...............Sheikh MOHAMMAD bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs....Sheikh HAMAD bin Jassim bin Jabr al-Thani</p>
<p> Health.................................Ali Said al-KHIYAREEN</p>
<p> Information &amp; Culture.............Hamad Abdul Aziz al-KAWARI</p>
<p> Interior..................................See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Justice............................Najeeb Mohammad al-NUAIMI</p>
<p> Minister of State.............Sheikh AHMAD bin Saif al-Thani</p>
<p> Minister of State..........................Sheikh HASSAN bin</p>
<p>					 Abdullah bin Mohammad al-Thani</p>
<p>Minister of State for Cabinet</p>
<p>     Affairs..............Sheikh MOHAMMAD bin Khaled al-Thani</p>
<p>Minister of State for Defence (Also Deputy Commander</p>
<p>     of Armed Forces)......Sheikh HAMAD bin Abdullah al-Thani</p>
<p>Minister of State for Foreign</p>
<p>     Affairs........................Ahmad Abdullah al-MAHMOOD</p>
<p>Municipal Affairs &amp;</p>
<p>     Agriculture..............Sheikh AHMAD bin Hamad al-Thani</p>
<p> Power &amp; Water..................Ahmad Mohammad Ali al-SUBAI'E</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor.........Abdullah bin Khaled al-ATTIYAH</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			    (End Government List)</p>
</text>
